if BENEFICIARY_NAME
  p Hi #{BENEFICIARY_NAME},
else
  p Hi,
p
  | The holder of the account #{USERNAME}
  if OPERATOR_NAME
    |  on #{OPERATOR_NAME}
  |  chose you to take over the management of this account. The transfer has started and is waiting for your answer.
if CLAIM_LINK
  if WINDOW_END
    p
      | To accept, follow this link before #{WINDOW_END}:
      |
      a(href=CLAIM_LINK target="_blank" rel="noopener") #{CLAIM_LINK}
  else
    p
      | To accept, follow this link:
      |
      a(href=CLAIM_LINK target="_blank" rel="noopener") #{CLAIM_LINK}
else if WINDOW_END
  p To accept, contact the support of this platform before #{WINDOW_END}.
else
  p To accept, contact the support of this platform.
p You will sign in with your own account on this platform, or create one, and then manage the account #{USERNAME}. You do not get the password of its holder: you reach the account through your own sign-in.
if IDENTITY_GIVEN
  p The account holder also gave your name, your date of birth, or both. This information is stored encrypted and is only used by the operator of the platform to identify you if this email cannot reach you. The operator can read it only after the transfer has started; each reading is logged and reported to the account holder. It is deleted when the transfer ends, whether it is completed or not.
if DECLINE_LINK
  p
    | If you do not want to take over this account, you can decline with this link; the account holder will then be told:
    |
    a(href=DECLINE_LINK target="_blank" rel="noopener") #{DECLINE_LINK}
if FALLBACK_DELETE
  p If you do not accept in time, or if you decline, the account and all its data will be deleted.
else if FALLBACK_KEEP
  p If you do not accept in time, or if you decline, the account stays as it is.
p If you do not know this person, you can ignore this message.
